Translation patch: impls of `MySerialize`/`MyDeserialize` for `&[u8]`, `[u8]`, `[u8; N]`, `f64`

Change: Adds `#[verify::start_from]` to these six impls (Cargo.toml: `start_from_attribute`, and rustc flags registering the `verify` tool).
Why: Charon `start_from` patterns only accept impls on named types (its pattern parser has no slice/array types and parses `f64` as a path), so these impls cannot be named there.
Behaviour: No code change: attributes only.

